Well, the first problem I wanted to solve was the error "dependencies in this file will not be discovered." as that is likely related to the error about leaflet not being found.

shinyapps.io <http://shinyapps.io> will attempt to run your application using the same locale rsconnect detected in your local environment. However that isn't always sufficient going from Windows (what you appear to be running) to Linux (what shinyapps.io <http://shinyapps.io> runs). So you might have to perform your file operations and be explicitly about using UTF-8.

